{"version":1,"key":"card:28","content":{"id":28,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设计师在给我切图时，一般会切 2x 或 3x 的图，为什么要切两倍或者三倍像素的图呢，这是为了保证图片看起来不模糊。为什么图片看起来会模糊呢，因为图片的大小对应的是"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":454,"contentType":"article","contentTitle":"1px 有多大","refId":4,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"物理像素而不是 CSS 像素"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而物理像素和 CSS 像素之间是相差 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 倍的，假设给的不是放大了的图，然后设置的 CSS 像素的值是图片的大小，由于相差 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 倍，图片就会被拉升，当然就会模糊了，所以设计会被 2x 和 3x 的图，这里的倍数就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果不想根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值使用不同的图片，就直接使用 3x 的图即可，缺点就是图片变大，加载速度变慢。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Canvas  也有这个问题，我们设置的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"width","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是物体像素，如果 CSS 设置相同的值，在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr > 1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的情况下，Canvas 绘制的图就会显得很模糊，所以要设置 Canvas 的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"width","code":true},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 CSS 宽度和高度的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 倍。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["Canvas/技巧","技巧/Canvas"],"createTime":1688953196434,"updateTime":1754033585688,"linkedCards":[{"id":44,"target":{"key":"card:44","type":"card","id":44},"summary":"在高分辨率屏幕 (dpr > 1) 上进行绘图时，会发现绘制的图像比较模糊，这是因为 Canvas 画布的单位不是一个 CSS 像素大小，而是一个物理像素大小。而 CSS 像素大小与物理像素大小相差 dpr 倍。当我们设置 Canvas 大...","tags":["Canvas/踩坑/绘图模糊","踩坑/Canvas"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1754033585688},"links":{"article:4":{"key":"article:4","type":"article","id":4}}}